 "scope": "research/curve25519_torus_native_20261115/lean-circuit-v1",
 "statement": "Three fixed numeric selector endpoints: at p=2^255-19, two natural values below32768 whose ZMod sum is20632 have that exact integer sum and selector below20633; the explicit p17,x31,d3 counterexample shows modular range equality alone need not encode the integer interval. No compiler, bit-vector decoding, prime-field or Fp2/map bridge is formalized by these endpoints."
